+# Super Mario Odyssey (0100000000010000): the rewriter's patches of this game's own builds.
+# dm/tools/patch_nso.py loads every profile's patches.py and applies those of a module's
+# NSO build ID; CUTS, OBS and FRAME_STEP as described there ("Registered patches").
+# Only FRAME_STEP is used here: the HUD edge-anchor hook (0118). There are no word
+# cuts and no observation gates.
